• Manage event logistics, venues, suppliers, agencies, production partners, budgets, attendee communications, promotions and on-the-day delivery.

• Deliver professional virtual and hybrid events using platforms such as&nbsp; Zoom and Microsoft Teams , including setup, speaker support, rehearsals and live-event coordination.

